---
description: Hard rule — never commit model weights, datasets, or caches
alwaysApply: true
---

Before every `git commit` / push:

1. Run `git diff --cached --stat` and ensure **no** files under `usg/zewnetrzne/`, `usg/dane/`, `usg/pamiec/`, `delphi/pamiec/`, or extensions `*.pt`, `*.pth`, `*.ckpt`, `*.onnx`, `*.safetensors`, `*.npz`.
2. If any staged binary **> 2 MB**, unstage it (`git reset HEAD -- <path>`).
3. Only **code** and **screenshots (PNG of outputs/UI)** may be added to the repo — not weights, recordings, or computed caches.